The following files are derived from that project and have been modified:

  crates/maker-arm-protocol/src/lib.rs
      Ported from maker_arm/protocol.py. Mirrors upstream's frame layout,
      CAN id construction, per-model u16 mapping ranges and rounding
      behavior; rewritten in Rust with different types and APIs. The wire
      bytes are intended to be identical to upstream's.

  crates/maker-arm-protocol/tests/vectors.rs
      Golden values taken from tests/unit/test_protocol.py
      (branch main, 2026-08-20). Reorganized into Rust tests and extended
      with cases that are not present upstream.

  bindings/maker-arm-py/tests/test_bindings.py
      Asserts the same golden values through the Python bindings.

All other files are original to this project.
